<title>POLAND: POLISH COPPER FIRM KGHM MAY NET UP TO PLN 51.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLISH COPPER FIRM KGHM MAY NET UP TO PLN 51.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    51.53 vs    35.90</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit     106.18 vs    65.40</p>
<p> Operating profit   107.45 vs    62.19</p>
<p> Sales		  364.30 vs   273.65</p>
